1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,036
An alcohol with one hydroxyl group is monohydric, general formula C n H two n plus one O H.

2
00:00:09,036 --> 00:00:15,768
Two hydroxyl groups make a dihydric alcohol like glycol, three a trihydric one like glycerol.

3
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:19,752
The carbon carrying the O H is called the carbinol carbon.

